<title>USA: St. Joe Q1 net decreases.</title>
<headline>St. Joe Q1 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter</p>
<p>							   1997	  1996</p>
<p> Net sales and operating revenues		$88.4     $171.0</p>
<p> Operating profit				     10.3	 93.4</p>
<p> Income from continuing operations		 8.0	 59.7</p>
<p> Earnings from discontinued operations	    --	  8.9</p>
<p> Net income						8.0	 68.6</p>
<p>Per share amounts:</p>
<p> Income from continuing operations		 .26	 1.96</p>
<p> Earnings from discontinued operations	    --	  .29</p>
<p> Net income					     0.26	 2.25</p>
<p>(dollars in millions except for share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE:  St. Joe Corp said net income for the first quarter of 1996 included an $84 million ($51.6 million net of tax) land sale to the State of Florida and earnings from discontinued operations of $8.9 million.</p>
</text>
